# Nothing is required. The playground runs in Scripted mode with zero secrets and zero
# external network calls, locally and on Vercel.
#
# Live mode is not wired yet (scripted only), so this key is unused for now. It is listed
# because a future live mode would reuse the same env name as apps/claude-agent-loops,
# read server-side only. Never add new secret names for this app.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
